{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42571","headline":"赠江处士 · 徐仲雅","name":"赠江处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"门在松阴里，山僧几度过。\n药灵丸不大，棊妙子无多。\n薄雾笼寒径，残风恋绿萝。\n金乌兼玉兔，年几奈公何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐仲雅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42571.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42571","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}